{"symbol":"WTN.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-12T22:41:09Z","info":{"address1":"Gdanska 60 Street","address2":"Palmiry CzosnOw","city":"Nowy Dwór Mazowiecki","zip":"05-152","country":"Poland","phone":"48 22 266 8800","website":"https://www.wittchen.com","industry":"Apparel Retail","industryKey":"apparel-retail","industryDisp":"Apparel Retail","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","sectorKey":"consumer-cyclical","sectorDisp":"Consumer Cyclical","longBusinessSummary":"Wittchen S.A. manufactures and sells luxury accessories, clothing, footwear, and luggage for men and women in Poland and Europe. The company offers messenger, shoulder, cross body, shopper, tote, hobo, waist, clutch, evening, and laptop bags, as well as backpacks; leather goods, such as wallets, cases, briefcases, business card holders, document holders, and organizers; and luggage products, including suitcases, cosmetic cases, travel bags, and travel accessories. It also provides clothing products comprising jackets, coats, gilets, and fur products; shoes consisting of sandals and flip flops, sneakers, and moccasins; ballerina, court, stiletto, and wedding shoes; ankle, Chelsea, knee high, combat, and cowboy boots, as well as sports shoes; and accessories, such as scarves, neckerchiefs, shawls, gloves, belts, umbrellas, socks, hats, keychains, masks, ties, and suspenders. It operates through a network of sales showrooms and retail stores, as well as an online store. The company was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Nowy Dwór Mazowiecki, Poland. Wittchen S.A. operates as a subsidiary of Simei Investments Ltd.","fullTimeEmployees":416,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jedrzej Rafal Wittchen","title":"CEO & President of the Management Board","exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":10.6,"open":10.62,"dayLow":10.62,"dayHigh":11.13,"regularMarketPreviousClose":10.6,"regularMarketOpen":10.62,"regularMarketDayLow":10.62,"regularMark